window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-418e376165928c0b"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"collaborate-in-space\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"space\">在 Space 中协作</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。如需查看文档的 Markdown 版本，可在页面 URL 末尾追加 <code>.md</code>。</p> </blockquote> <p>你可以单独共享某个页面；在支持的情况下，也可以共享整个 Space，让其他人访问一组相关页面。你还可以共享幻灯片，一起制作演示文稿。</p> <p><a id=\"choose-an-access-level\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">选择访问级别</h2> <p>共享设置会显示该页面或 Space 可用的权限。可选角色还取决于接收者类型；例如，邀请某人加入 Team 时，可能只有查看或编辑权限，而没有评论权限。</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>访问权限</th> <th>适用情形</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>查看</td> <td>对方只需要阅读内容。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>评论</td> <td>对方需要阅读内容并留下反馈。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>编辑</td> <td>对方需要与你一起修改内容。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>你必须拥有管理共享的权限，才能更改其他人的访问权限。可邀请的对象和共享选项取决于你的账户和工作区。</p> <p>有关工作区共享控制，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-418e376165928c0b?anchor=for-workspace-admins\">管理 Space 共享</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"share-a-page-or-space\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"space_1\">共享页面或 Space</h2> <ol> <li>打开你想共享的页面或 Space。</li> <li>打开共享设置，并从可用对象中添加要邀请的人员或 Teams。</li> <li>选择访问级别并保存。</li> <li>确认协作者能够以预期权限打开内容。</li> </ol> <p>共享前，请检查谁能访问该页面，以及页面是否包含来自私人来源的信息。</p> <p><a id=\"understand-inherited-access\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">了解继承的访问权限</h2> <p>共享 Space 的访问权限会应用到其中的页面。共享一个页面也会授予对方访问其子页面的权限。共享设置会区分直接授予的访问权限，以及从父页面或 Space 继承的访问权限。</p> <p>移除直接邀请，并不会撤销对方仍从父页面或 Space 继承的访问权限。需要更改此类访问权限时，请检查父页面或 Space 的共享设置。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：Offsite plan 页面的共享对话框显示工作区链接访问权限、所有者，以及从 Team offsite Space 继承的查看权限。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"for-workspace-admins\"></a></p> <p><strong>面向工作区管理员：</strong>有关工作区共享控制、设置和安全治理指南，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-315e17f0f4b919c1\">管理 ChatGPT Space</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"review-together\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">一起审阅</h2> <p>使用评论讨论问题或提出修改请求。对于应该直接更新内容的协作者，请授予编辑权限。请其他智能体修改共享内容时，明确指出要修改的部分，并保留团队已经作出的决定。</p> <p>请单独检查链接来源资料的访问权限。能够阅读页面的协作者，仍可能没有权限打开页面链接的来源。</p> <p><a id=\"collaborate-on-slides\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">协作制作幻灯片</h2> <p>在 Space 中打开幻灯片，然后使用共享设置邀请协作者。需要阅读幻灯片的人可获得查看权限；需要修改的人可获得编辑权限。目前 Slides 支持查看和编辑，暂不提供单独的“仅评论”角色。</p> <p>获得编辑权限后，你和队友可以同时修改同一份幻灯片。你们可以使用共享评论讨论反馈、提及队友，或提及 ChatGPT 或你的 dot 来请求更新。要修改某个具体元素，请选择该元素并点击 <strong>Request edits（请求修改）</strong>。</p> <p>要开始制作幻灯片、完善内容或导出结果，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-71293722d815f9b8?anchor=create-and-refine-slides\">创建和完善幻灯片</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"resolve-an-access-problem\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">解决访问问题</h2> <p>如果有人无法打开内容，请确认对方使用的是预期的账户和工作区，然后检查页面或 Space 中保存的权限。如果你无法编辑内容或管理共享，请联系具有相应权限的人员处理。</p> <p>有关共同创作内容的指南，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-c7393fbab700d02d\">页面</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-2d083870d670ea3a\">与智能体协作</a>。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"collaborate-in-space\">Collaborate in Space</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Share a page on its own or, where available, share a Space to give people access to a group of related pages. You can also share a slide deck to work on a presentation together.</p> <h2 id=\"choose-an-access-level\">Choose an access level</h2> <p>The sharing controls show the permissions available for the page or Space. Available roles also depend on the recipient type; a Team invitation may offer view or edit access without comment access.</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Access</th> <th>Use it when someone needs to</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>View</td> <td>Read the work.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Comment</td> <td>Read the work and leave feedback.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Edit</td> <td>Change the content with you.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>You need permission to manage sharing before you can change someone else's access. Available recipients and sharing options depend on your account and workspace.</p> <p>For workspace sharing controls, see <a href=\"#/article/a-418e376165928c0b?anchor=for-workspace-admins\">Manage Space sharing</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"share-a-page-or-space\">Share a page or Space</h2> <ol> <li>Open the page or Space you want to share.</li> <li>Open its sharing controls and add the intended people or Teams from the available options.</li> <li>Choose an access level and save.</li> <li>Confirm that a collaborator can open the work with the expected permission.</li> </ol> <p>Before sharing, check who can access the page and whether it contains information from private sources.</p> <h2 id=\"understand-inherited-access\">Understand inherited access</h2> <p>Access to a shared Space applies to its pages. Sharing a page also grants access to its child pages. The sharing controls distinguish direct access from access inherited from a parent page or Space.</p> <p>Removing a direct invitation doesn't remove access that someone still inherits from a parent page or Space. Review the parent or Space's sharing controls when you need to change that access.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: A page sharing dialog for Offsite plan shows workspace link access, the owner, and view access inherited from the Team offsite Space.</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"for-workspace-admins\"></a></p> <p><strong>For workspace admins:</strong> See <a href=\"#/article/a-315e17f0f4b919c1\">Manage ChatGPT Space</a> for workspace sharing controls, setup, and security and governance guidance.</p> <h2 id=\"review-together\">Review together</h2> <p>Use comments to discuss a question or request a change. Give edit access to collaborators who should update the content directly. When asking an agent to revise shared work, identify the section it should change and preserve the decisions your team has already made.</p> <p>Check access to linked source material separately. A collaborator who can read your page may still lack permission to open a source linked from it.</p> <h2 id=\"collaborate-on-slides\">Collaborate on slides</h2> <p>Open a deck in Space and use its sharing controls to invite collaborators. Choose view access for people who need to read the deck or edit access for people who will revise it with you. Slides currently supports view and edit access; a separate comment-only role isn't available.</p> <p>With edit access, you and your teammates can change the same deck at the same time. Use shared comments to discuss feedback, mention a teammate, or mention ChatGPT or your dot to request an update. For a change to a specific element, select it and choose <strong>Request edits</strong>.</p> <p>To start a deck, refine its content, or export the result, see <a href=\"#/article/a-71293722d815f9b8?anchor=create-and-refine-slides\">Create and refine slides</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"resolve-an-access-problem\">Resolve an access problem</h2> <p>If someone can't open the work, check that they are using the intended account and workspace, then review the page or Space's saved permissions. If you can't edit or manage sharing, ask someone with the appropriate access to make the change.</p> <p>For guidance on developing the content together, see <a href=\"#/article/a-c7393fbab700d02d\">Pages</a> and <a href=\"#/article/a-2d083870d670ea3a\">Work with the agent</a>.</p>"};
